<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{headline}}</title>
<!-- THE ACTIVE-CLIENT ALERT. Rebuilt 2026-09-15 from Design's Claude Design export
     (GRANTED_Grant_Alert_v2) — the REAL artboard markup, not a reverse-engineered PDF.
     The sibling grant-alert.hbs is the PROSPECT/LEAD one (cold outreach) and is untouched.

     Structure (from the design): a 4px orange top rule; a NAVY dot-pattern HERO carrying the
     logo row, the monospace kicker, a white serif title + a bordered fit-score block,
     the description, and outline tag chips; a WHITE stats card that OVERLAPS UP into the hero
     (margin-top:-52px + shadow) whose last tile is the deep-orange DEADLINE tile; stacked
     Who-can-apply then the Grant Intelligence callout; and an ABSOLUTELY-positioned bottom
     stack (Your Call band + footer) pinned to the fixed letter page.

     Colours are CONFORMED to lib/brand.ts, not copied: the design's #A8501A eyebrow IS the
     platform's orangeDeep; the design's deep-orange deadline fill #B3541E conforms to
     orangeFill #B85A17 (the sanctioned white-on-orange fill — the banned #b3541e never
     appears). Brand orange #E4761F, navy #0B1E3A elsewhere.

     Fonts embedded as local @font-face data URIs at render time (lib/alerts/render.ts):
     Source Serif 4 (display), Inter Tight (body), JetBrains Mono (the .mono kicker +
     micro-labels — vendored latin-400 from the Design export). No CDN <link> — serverless
     Chromium has no gstatic egress. -->
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #e8e2d8; }
  .mono { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; }
  @page { size: letter; margin: 0; }
  @media print {
    html { -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; print-color-adjust: exact; }
    html, body { background: #fff; }
    .brief-page { box-shadow: none !important; margin: 0 !important; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="brief-page" style="width:816px; height:1056px; position:relative; overflow:hidden; display:flex; flex-direction:column; margin:24px auto; background:#fff; color:#3c4150; font-family:'Inter Tight', sans-serif; box-shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(11,30,58,0.18);">

  <!-- top orange rule -->
  <div style="height:4px; background:#E4761F; flex-shrink:0;"></div>

  <!-- ===================== HERO (navy dot band) ===================== -->
  <div style="flex-shrink:0; background:#0B1E3A radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.055) 1px, transparent 1.2px) 0 0/22px 22px; padding:30px 46px 60px 46px;">

    <!-- REAL brand lockup (public/granted-lockup-dark.svg, white artwork), inlined as a data URI by
         render.ts — mark + GRANTED wordmark + "More Grants. Less Grind." tagline in one authentic asset,
         the same lockup the app login uses. Replaces the reconstructed PNG mark + text wordmark + separate
         text tagline; the tagline is part of the lockup, so there is no separate right-side tagline. -->
    <div style="height:38px;">
      <img src="assets/granted-lockup-white.svg" alt="GRANTED — More Grants. Less Grind." style="display:block; height:38px; width:auto;">
    </div>

    <!-- kicker: program · abbrev · FY · FON (mono, uppercase, letter-spaced; no nowrap so a long one wraps rather than clipping) -->
    <div class="mono" style="margin-top:26px; font-size:10px; line-height:14px; letter-spacing:0.16em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#E4761F;">
      {{programName}}{{#if programShort}}&nbsp;&nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;&nbsp;{{programShort}}{{/if}}{{#if fiscalYear}}&nbsp;&nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;&nbsp;{{fiscalYear}}{{/if}}{{#if fon}}&nbsp;&nbsp;&middot;&nbsp;&nbsp;FON {{fon}}{{/if}}
    </div>

    <!-- title (white serif) + fit-score block (client template only; bordered on the navy) -->
    <div style="margin-top:10px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:32px;">
      <!-- Hero title in the BRAND heading serif (Libre Baskerville, `font-serif`), with the single most
           distinctive word italic-orange — the SAME treatment as the app grant-report title (EmphasizedTitle
           / titleParts). headlineHtml is built server-side in data.ts (esc'd text + the one <em>); the em word
           inherits 700 and gets CSS faux-italic, exactly as the browser renders it. -->
      <h1 style="margin:0; font-family:'Libre Baskerville', Georgia, serif; font-weight:700; font-size:43px; line-height:1.1; letter-spacing:-0.01em; color:#fff; max-width:470px;">{{{headlineHtml}}}</h1>
      {{#if fitScore}}
      <div style="flex-shrink:0; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.28); padding:14px 20px 14px 14px;">
        <div style="width:50px; height:50px; flex-shrink:0; border:1px solid #E4761F; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:1px;">
          <div style="font-family:'Source Serif 4', serif; font-weight:600; font-size:24px; line-height:24px; color:#fff;">{{fitScore}}</div>
          <div class="mono" style="font-size:8px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:rgba(255,255,255,.72);">of 3</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="mono" style="font-size:9px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:rgba(255,255,255,.72);">Fit Score</div>
          <div style="margin-top:4px; font-family:'Source Serif 4', serif; font-weight:600; font-size:21px; line-height:24px; color:#E4761F;">{{fitScoreLabel}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      {{/if}}
    </div>

    <!-- description (white on navy) -->
    <p style="margin:18px 0 0; font-size:14px; line-height:21px; color:rgba(255,255,255,.86); max-width:700px; text-align:justify;">{{{introHtml}}}{{#if statePassThrough}} In {{state}} it runs through the {{administeringAgency}} as a pass-through, so your application competes only against other in-state organizations, not the entire country.{{/if}}</p>

    <!-- tag chips (outline on navy) -->
    {{#if whatItFunds.length}}
    <div style="margin-top:14px; display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:6px;">
      {{#each whatItFunds}}
      <span style="border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.26); padding:4px 9px; font-size:10.5px; line-height:13px; color:rgba(255,255,255,.88);">{{this}}</span>
      {{/each}}
    </div>
    {{/if}}
  </div>

  <!-- ===================== STATS CARD (overlaps hero) ===================== -->
  <!-- White card pulled UP 52px so it straddles the navy hero / white body edge. The last
       tile is the deep-orange DEADLINE tile (orangeFill), showing the ABSOLUTE date only — the
       "N days left" countdown was removed (Shannon, 2026-09-15): a time-relative sub-line baked into
       a save-once draft goes stale on the calendar clock. The `award range` label is KEPT (Shannon's
       call), not the design's "Award ceiling" — it is a range. -->
  <div style="flex-shrink:0; margin:-52px 46px 0 46px; position:relative; display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat({{stats.length}}, minmax(0, 1fr)); background:#fff; box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(11,30,58,.14);">
    {{#each stats}}
    {{#if this.highlight}}
    <div style="min-width:0; overflow:hidden; background:#B85A17; padding:18px 12px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:6px;">
      <div style="width:100%; text-align:center; overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap; font-family:'Source Serif 4', serif; font-weight:600; font-size:26px; line-height:28px; color:#fff;">{{this.value}}</div>
      <div class="mono" style="width:100%; text-align:center; overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap; font-size:8px; letter-spacing:0.16em; text-transform:uppercase; color:rgba(255,255,255,.85);">{{this.label}}</div>
    </div>
    {{else}}
    <div style="min-width:0; overflow:hidden; padding:18px 12px; {{#unless @first}}border-left:1px solid #e8e2d6; {{/unless}}display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:6px;">
      <div style="width:100%; text-align:center; overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap; font-family:'Source Serif 4', serif; font-weight:600; font-size:26px; line-height:28px; color:#0B1E3A;">{{this.value}}</div>
      <div class="mono" style="width:100%; text-align:center; overflow:hidden; text-overflow:ellipsis; white-space:nowrap; font-size:8px; letter-spacing:0.16em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#6E7683;">{{this.label}}</div>
    </div>
    {{/if}}
    {{/each}}
  </div>
  {{#if statsFootnote}}
  <div style="font-size:10px; line-height:1.4; margin:8px 46px 0 46px; color:#6b7688;">{{statsFootnote}}</div>
  {{/if}}

  <!-- ===================== WHO CAN APPLY, then GRANT INTELLIGENCE ===================== -->
  <!-- flex:1 + min-height:0 + overflow:hidden: this is the ONE region that flexes to fill the fixed
       letter page, so the bottom band below is ALWAYS a normal flow child pinned to the page bottom
       (never position:absolute painting over content). If a grant's eligibility + narrative genuinely
       overrun, they clip cleanly at the band edge instead of sliding UNDER it. -->
  <div style="flex:1 1 auto; min-height:0; overflow:hidden; padding:16px 46px 16px 46px;">
    <div>
      <div class="mono" style="font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#A8501A;">Who can apply</div>
      <p style="margin:12px 0 0; font-size:13.5px; line-height:21px; color:#3c4150; text-align:justify;">{{{eligibilityHtml}}}</p>
      {{#if eligibilityNote}}
      <div style="margin-top:12px; background:#faf7f2; border-left:3px solid #E4761F; padding:10px 14px;">
        <div class="mono" style="font-size:9.5px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#A8501A; margin-bottom:3px;">{{eligibilityNote.label}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:12px; line-height:1.45; color:#3c4150;">{{eligibilityNote.body}}</div>
      </div>
      {{/if}}
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top:16px; background:#faf7f2; border-left:3px solid #E4761F; padding:15px 24px;">
      <div class="mono" style="font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#A8501A;">Grant Intelligence</div>
      <p style="margin:12px 0 0; font-size:13.5px; line-height:21px; color:#3c4150; text-align:justify;">{{#if grantIntelligence}}{{grantIntelligence}}{{else}}We will scope how your organization would run this programme once you tell us to proceed.{{/if}}</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ===================== BOTTOM (pinned to the letter page via flex, not absolute) ===================== -->
  <!-- Your Call band + footer. A NORMAL flex child (flex-shrink:0) after the flex:1 content region, so it
       always sits flush at the page bottom AND is never painted over the content above it (the absolute
       positioning it replaced clipped the Grant Intelligence narrative when a grant ran long). One reliable
       way through — a portal deep link, not two PDF buttons (a PDF's links are unreliable in Gmail's
       preview; one-click lives in the EMAIL). -->
  <div style="flex-shrink:0;">
    <div style="height:3px; background:#E4761F;"></div>
    <div style="height:124px; background:#0B1E3A; padding:0 46px; box-sizing:border-box; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:40px;">
      <div style="max-width:430px;">
        <div class="mono" style="font-size:10px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#E4761F;">Your call</div>
        <p style="margin:10px 0 0; font-size:12.5px; line-height:18px; color:rgba(255,255,255,.92); text-wrap:pretty;">Tell us how to proceed. <strong style="font-weight:700; color:#fff;">Interested</strong> moves this into your grant report for full analysis; <strong style="font-weight:700; color:#fff;">Pass</strong> clears it off your list.</p>
        <p style="margin:8px 0 0; font-size:10.5px; line-height:14.5px; color:rgba(255,255,255,.62); text-wrap:pretty;">You can answer in one click straight from the alert email, or just reply to it. Not ready this cycle? Pass and we position you for the next one.</p>
      </div>
      {{#if portalUrl}}
      <a href="{{portalUrl}}" style="width:306px; height:44px; flex-shrink:0; background:#E4761F; text-decoration:none; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:12px;">
        <span style="font-size:13px; font-weight:700; color:#fff;">Review and decide in your portal</span>
        <span style="font-size:15px; color:#fff; line-height:1;">&rarr;</span>
      </a>
      {{else}}
      <div style="width:306px; flex-shrink:0; box-sizing:border-box; border:1px solid rgba(250,247,242,0.35); padding:12px 16px; font-size:12px; line-height:1.45; color:#cdd6e2;">Answer from the alert email, or reply to it and we will record your decision.</div>
      {{/if}}
    </div>
    <div style="height:3px; background:#E4761F;"></div>
    <div style="height:50px; padding:0 46px; box-sizing:border-box; background:#fff; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:24px;">
      <!-- REAL brand lockup (public/granted-lockup-light.svg, navy artwork) — mark + wordmark + tagline in
           one authentic asset, replacing the reconstructed PNG mark + text wordmark + text tagline. -->
      <img src="assets/granted-lockup-navy.svg" alt="GRANTED — More Grants. Less Grind." style="display:block; height:24px; width:auto; flex-shrink:0;">
      <div style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:22px; font-size:12.5px;">
        <span style="font-weight:700; color:#0B1E3A;">grantedco.com</span>
        <span style="color:#3c4150;">support@grantedco.com</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
</body>
</html>
